    "chunk_text": "e heo Ond we ealle mid Cristes rode tacne f\u00e6stnodon & underwreoton, we \u00fea \u00f0e asetton \u00feone allican W\u00e6s eac swylce in \u00fe\u00e6m seono\u00f0e, & \u00e6tg\u00e6dre trymede \u00fea domas \u00fe\u00e6s ilcan geleafan se arwyr\u00f0a W\u00e6s him latteow se arwyr\u00f0a abbud, \u00fee mon heht Benedictus. Mid \u00fey se ilca Benedictus mynster getimbrode in Breotone in are Sancte Petres \u00fe\u00e6s W\u00e6s his gewuna, \u00fe\u00e6t he eac oft \u00e6r on \u00fe\u00e6re fore w\u00e6s. Ond he arwyr\u00f0lice from \u00fe\u00e6re eadgan gemynde Agothones \u00fe\u00e6s papan onfongen w\u00e6s. Ond he b\u00e6d & onfeng in trymnesse \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres freodomes from him, \u00fee he geworhte, For\u00feon \u00fee him \u00fea londare forgeaf & sealde, \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6t mynster on getimbrade. \u00dea onfeng he eac \u00feone foresprecenan abbud Iohannem & in Breotone gel\u00e6dde, \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde \u00dea dyde he Iohannes, swa \u00fe\u00e6s papan bebod w\u00e6s; endebyrdnesse & \u00feeaw \u00fe\u00e6s songes cwicre & \u00fea \u00fee se hring ealles geares in weor\u00f0unge symbeldaga ab\u00e6dde, eac swilce stafum awrat & on Swylce he Iohannes eac o\u00f0er bebod from \u00fe\u00e6m apostolican papan onfeng, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6t sceolde For \u00fe\u00e6re wisan w\u00e6s se seono\u00f0 gesomnad in Breotone, \u00fee we \u00e6r s\u00e6gdon. & \u00fea w\u00e6s gemeted in eallum ungewemmed geleafa & riht; ond him w\u00e6s seald seo bysen on \u00dea he \u00fea w\u00e6",
